silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_02_identifier_leg_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "IdentifierLegYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_02_identifier_leg_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'IdentifierLegYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Identifier Leg', the identifier_leg_arrow is MicrochipID_44 -> MittensColimitApex: the ISO 11784 chip identifier leg; it is monic (one chip, one individual) but not epic; it does not make the chip number identical to Mittens.; also, In 'Identifier Leg', the scan_event_arrow witnesses the physical provenance of MicrochipID_44 from the Tartu Animal Clinic scanner read event in May 2026." .
